First of all you have to initialie your code by using -> git init
Add all the changes you have made by using            -> git add .
You have to make sure that you are taking the 
authorization of that code by using                   -> git config user.name "your github user name"
Also add the github account email by using            -> git config user.email "your github email"
After that commit your changes by using               -> git commit -m "write changes here"
Now connect you local repo with github repo by using  -> git remote add origin "your repo link"
push your code to the main branch                     -> git push -u origin main